s":["Qism / Wazan","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["عَذَابٌ ke Awsaf","عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ / أَلِيمٌ / عَظِيمٌ / مُهِينٌ","Sakht / dardnaak / bada / ruswa karne wala azaab"],["كِتَابٌ / قُرْآنٌ ke Awsaf","كِتَابٌ مُبِينٌ / قُرْآنٌ مَجِيدٌ / كَرِيمٌ","Wazih Kitaab / Buland-shaan aur ba-izzat Qur'an"],["قَوْلٌ / صِرَاطٌ ke Awsaf","قَوْلًا سَدِيدًا / قَوْلٌ مَعْرُوفٌ","Seedhi-sachchi baat / Bhali baat"]]}},{"id":"sec_s3l2_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 3 • LESSON 2</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Sifat-o-Mawsoof (2 — Ek Ism ke Mukhtalif Awsaf): عَذَابٌ ← عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ ، عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ (Page 80–82)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">عَذَابٌ ، كِتَابٌ ، قَوْلٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Mawsoof + Sifaat</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ ، عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ ، عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• عَذَابٌ ، كِتَابٌ ، قَوْلٌ (Azaab, Kitaab, Baat) se عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ ، عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ ، عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ (Sakht azaab, dardnaak azaab, bada azaab) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Sifat-Mawsoof, Izaafat, Asmaa-ul-Faa'il aur Tasniyah Qur'ani tarakeeb ki buniyaad hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 80–82):** Is sabaq mein Qur'an Majeed ke 18 aham asmaa (`عَذَابٌ`، `كِتَابٌ`، `رَسُولٌ`، `قُرْآنٌ`، `قَوْلٌ`، `يَوْمٌ`، `شَيْءٌ`، `مَكَانٌ`، `سِحْرٌ`، `فَضْلٌ`، `كَلِمَةٌ`، `شَجَرَةٌ`، `ضَلَالٌ`، `أُمَّةٌ`، `عَدُوٌّ`، `أَجَلٌ`) ke saath aane wali mukhtalif sifaat yakja ki gayi hain."}},{"id":"sec_s3l2_r1","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Iss sabaq mein hum dekhenge ke ek hi Isim (Noun) ke saath mukhtalif Sifat (Adjectives) kis tarah aati hain. Iss sabaq mein Mausoof laal rang mein numayan hai, jabke Sifat siyah rang mein hai."}},{"id":"sec_s3l2_lbl2","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"عَذَابٌ — Azab (Azab ke mukhtalif awsaf)"}},{"id":"sec_s3l2_r3","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"عَذَابٌ lafz laal rang mein hai aur iski mukhtalif sifat (sakht, dardnaak, azeem) ka mutala karein."}},{"id":"sec_s3l2_g4","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s3l2_g4_w1","arabic":"عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَدِيدٌ</span>","hinglish":"Sakht azab","translations":{"en":"A severe punishment","ur":"سخت عذاب","hi":"सख़्त अज़ाब"}},{"id":"s3l2_g4_w2","arabic":"عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَلِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Dardnaak azab","translations":{"en":"A painful punishment","ur":"دردناک عذاب","hi":"दर्दनाक अज़ाब"}},{"id":"s3l2_g4_w3","arabic":"عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَظِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Bada azab","translations":{"en":"A great punishment","ur":"بڑا عذاب","hi":"बड़ा अज़ाब"}},{"id":"s3l2_g4_w4","arabic":"عَذَابٌ مُقِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُقِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Hamesha rehne wala azab","translations":{"en":"An enduring punishment","ur":"ہمیشہ رہنے والا عذاب","hi":"हमेशा रहने वाला अज़ाब"}},{"id":"s3l2_g4_w5","arabic":"عَذَابٌ قَرِيبٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَرِيبٌ</span>","hinglish":"Qareeb ka azab","translations":{"en":"A near punishment","ur":"قریب کا عذاب","hi":"क़रीब का अज़ाब"}},{"id":"s3l2_g4_w6","arabic":"عَذَابٌ مُهِينٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُهِينٌ</span>","hinglish":"Ruswa karne wala azab","translations":{"en":"A humiliating punishment","ur":"رسوا کرنے والا عذاب","hi":"रुसवा करने वाला अज़ाब"}},{"id":"s3l2_g4_w7","arabic":"عَذَابًا شَدِيدًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَدِيدًا</span>","hinglish":"Sakht azab","translations":{"en":"A severe punishment","ur":"سخت عذاب","hi":"सख़्त अज़ाब"}},{"id":"s3l2_g4_w8","arabic":"عَذَابًا قَرِيبًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابًا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَرِيبًا</span>","hinglish":"Qareeb ka azab","translations":{"en":"A near punishment","ur":"قریب کا عذاب","hi":"क़रीब का अज़ाब"}},{"id":"s3l2_g4_w9","arabic":"عَذَابٌ غَلِيظٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابٌ</